{"status":"completed","summary":"Restored branch_orders on node1 using RHEL-native MariaDB 10.11. All supplied keys, relationships, and decimal values are intact. Node2 has persistent read-only reporting access, while the administrator retains write access. Both nodes restarted individually and fully recovered without changing RHEL 10.0 or kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.","actions_performed":["Installed MariaDB server on node1 and client on node2 from configured RHEL repositories.","Imported the original SQL export without modifying it.","Created a credential-protected reporting account restricted to node2 and granted only SELECT on branch_orders.","Restricted TCP/3306 through firewalld to node2's exact address.","Verified administrator writes and reporting-account write denial.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Restore supplied primary keys, relationships, and exact monetary values","command_ids":["cmd-aa50280279754d8b","cmd-a22bca4c812c4a39"],"summary":"Schema confirms both primary keys, the customer foreign key, and DECIMAL(10,2). The joined rows preserve IDs 101–103 and amounts 12.35, 99.90, and 0.05 with zero orphans."},{"requirement":"Preserve the SQL export","command_ids":["cmd-014d06c2553d4552","cmd-a22bca4c812c4a39","cmd-b740275b88ff4634"],"summary":"The export retained SHA-256 1311c3635d31265b3dfa067fe371ac457e8bd6e7529374aa6f254e1777b48a37 before import and after restart."},{"requirement":"Node2 reporting account can read but cannot change orders or customers","command_ids":["cmd-46bcbb06589b4b68","cmd-6567c3f40bea4667","cmd-6c1053d03ecc4856","cmd-519d5e5bb8d94a3e"],"summary":"The account has only SELECT, successfully reads both tables remotely, and receives ERROR 1142 for UPDATE and DELETE attempts."},{"requirement":"Database administrator retains write access","command_ids":["cmd-e12fd9ae745449a7","cmd-b740275b88ff4634"],"summary":"Administrator test inserts succeeded before and after restart, then were rolled back with no residual rows."},{"requirement":"Keep installed OS release and kernel; use compatible software","command_ids":["cmd-f0b07e2f78814b65","cmd-f0b6efdc360046b0","cmd-a22bca4c812c4a39","cmd-519d5e5bb8d94a3e"],"summary":"Both nodes remain RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0 and use repository-provided MariaDB 10.11."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-a22bca4c812c4a39","cmd-65d9791104c84f1f","cmd-632b482930f44e62","cmd-8dcf5a8554094f4d","cmd-3ea393b151474de5"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID f455a75c… changed to 6867f247… after acknowledged reboot; MariaDB, data integrity, export, and remote reporting access recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-b16be6b5928e441a","cmd-c0f17c9f8b9c483b","cmd-7a7ea1e551944ad8","cmd-519d5e5bb8d94a3e"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 03273aa8… changed to e83e19a8… after acknowledged reboot; secured client configuration, remote reads, exact data, and write denial persisted."}]}
